{
  "_about": [
    "Positions of the CUTE magnetic diagnostics in the poloidal (R, Z) plane.",
    "Transcribed from the table 'CUTE diagnostics' supplied by the CUTE group. Flux loops were given in meters;",
    "magnetic probe positions were given in centimeters and are converted to meters here.",
    "flux_loops: FS = loops on the vessel, FC = loops on the center column. Each measures poloidal flux psi.",
    "magnetic_probes: each measures B_R*N_R + B_Z*N_Z, the field along its unit vector (N_R, N_Z).",
    "phi_deg is the toroidal angle of the probe. In the source table it was written as a suffix after a",
    "character that did not survive export (e.g. 'S01?180'); it is written 'S01@180' here. Unsuffixed probes are at 0.",
    "All values are copied as given, including the S04 / S04@180 N_R magnitudes (0.5584 vs 0.5582)."
  ],
  "units": {
    "R": "m",
    "Z": "m",
    "phi_deg": "degrees"
  },
